OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786745066
OL,3,CCould #12billion of investment be
OL,4,Ccoming to West Cumbria?
OL,6,FBringing nuclear power back to West
OL,7,FCumbria has long been the goal.
OL,9,FThis month marks the 70th anniversary
OL,10,Fof Calder Hall generating its first
OL,11,Felectricity at Sellafield, but it's
OL,12,Fbeen over two decades since power was
OL,13,Fproduced here as decommissioning took
OL,14,Fover.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
