CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786745066
OL,3,CCould #12billion of investment be
OL,4,Ccoming to West Cumbria?
OL,6,FPioneer Park could change all that.
OL,7,FThe hurdles ahead are massive - not
OL,8,Fleast securing #12 billion in private
OL,9,Fcapital, enough to buy several of the
OL,10,Fworld's biggest football clubs. And
OL,11,Fthis isn't the first time new nuclear
OL,12,Fhas been promised for Moorside, only
OL,13,Fto collapse.
OL,15,FBut with government backing behind the
OL,16,Fmasterplan and rising energy demand
OL,17,Ffor AI tech, could it be different
OL,18,Fthis time round?
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
