OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786745066
OL,3,CCould #12billion of investment be
OL,4,Ccoming to West Cumbria?
OL,6,FTwelve billion pounds of private
OL,7,Finvestment is the target required to
OL,8,Ftransform a field just outside of
OL,9,FEurope's largest nuclear site.
OL,11,FLast year, the government awarded
OL,12,F#1million to local regeneration
OL,13,Fcompany BEC to draw up a clean energy
OL,14,Fmasterplan for the land.
OL,16,FMichael Pemberton from BEC told ITV
OL,17,FBorder: "The ambition is three small
OL,18,Fmodular nuclear reactors powering two
OL,19,FAI data centres.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786745066
OL,3,CCould #12billion of investment be
OL,4,Ccoming to West Cumbria?
OL,6,F"We have many who want to invest in
OL,7,Fthat, want to invest in this area. And
OL,8,Fof course, what they want to do is
OL,9,Fdiversify their portfolio, which is
OL,10,Fwhy they're investing in energy and
OL,11,Fenergy tech.
OL,13,F"That's what you're seeing more and
OL,14,Fmore of. We have a lot of
OL,15,Forganisations who are willing to do
OL,16,Fthat."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
