FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786745066
OL,3,CCould #12billion of investment be
OL,4,Ccoming to West Cumbria?
OL,6,FThe #12bn figure will be phased over
OL,7,Fnine or ten years, as Pioneer Park
OL,8,Fprogresses. The land is currently
OL,9,Fowned by the Nuclear Decommissioning
OL,10,FAuthority, and is known as the
OL,11,FMoorside Site.
OL,13,FIt's not the first time there have
OL,14,Fbeen plans to put nuclear in some
OL,15,Fcapacity on this land, but none of the
OL,16,Fprevious attempts have ever got off
OL,17,Fthe ground.
OL,19,FIf these plans succeed, it is thought
OL,20,Fthousands of jobs could be created.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
