PN,32206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786745066
OL,3,CCould #12billion of investment be
OL,4,Ccoming to West Cumbria?
OL,6,FLucy Jarvis, a STEM degree apprentice,
OL,7,Fsaid: "I feel like it can bring a lot
OL,8,Fof opportunities to young people in
OL,9,Fthe area. And not just my generation,
OL,10,Fbut also the future generations in the
OL,11,Farea as well.
OL,13,F"It also brings jobs for local people
OL,14,Fand opportunities for young people to
OL,15,Fget the experience through
OL,16,Fapprenticeship schemes, such as the
OL,17,Fone I've been on."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
