CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786745066
OL,3,CCould #12billion of investment be
OL,4,Ccoming to West Cumbria?
OL,6,FWhen asked whether West Cumbria's
OL,7,Fexisting transport infrastructure
OL,8,Fcould cope with such a development,
OL,9,Fthe area's MP Josh MacAllister said:
OL,10,F"We want to make sure you can bring in
OL,11,Fimprovements to infrastructure. The
OL,12,Ftwo things go hand in hand together.
OL,14,F"The top priority for me in regards to
OL,15,Fthat is ensuring that we upgrade our
OL,16,Frail track and deal with the immediate
OL,17,Fissue of reopening that tunnel at
OL,18,FBransty so that we can have that
OL,19,Fcontinuous rail link between here,
OL,20,FCarlisle, and the rest of the world."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/8
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
