OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786745066
OL,3,CCould #12billion of investment be
OL,4,Ccoming to West Cumbria?
OL,6,FBEC is expected to unveil the draft
OL,7,Fmasterplan later this year ahead of
OL,8,Fexpected ground surveys in 2027,
OL,9,Fthough several hurdles remain before
OL,10,Fany construction can begin.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G8/8
